      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "skill_id": 54800,
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "drifting shot",
          "desc": "Goya fights in a sand boat and can attack while moving, but the sand boat has great inertia and has extra time for starting acceleration and braking deceleration. Long press the basic attack to put the sand boat into the preparatory acceleration mode, which can be charged up to three levels. After letting go, the sand boat will start very quickly according to the charging level (the cooldown is 20 to 16 seconds, which decreases with the level. The starting speed is affected by the movement speed and level). Tap a basic attack and the hand crossbow will shoot 3 times quickly, causing the sand boat to brake and enter a drifting state, causing 6 (+22% physical attack) physical damage each time. Shooting 6 times in a row will add a powerful shot, causing 40 (+100% physical attack) physical damage, and the sand boat will accelerate to start. Goya will initially gain 50% attack speed, but the additional attack speed gains she gains from equipment and skills will be halved. The orb effect attached to each arrow only causes 35% damage.",
          "cd": "0",
          "cost": "0",
          "tags": [
            "Rapid Fire",
            "Movement"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/548/54800.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 54801,
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "ejection start",
          "desc": "Goya causes the sand boat to explode and accelerate. If it uses normal attacks and turns during the acceleration, it will splash black sand at the nearest enemy according to the drifting direction, causing 200/240/280/320/360/400 (+50% physical attack) physical damage and 50% slowdown, lasting 0.5 seconds. The faster Goya moves, the greater the burst acceleration; black sand causes an additional 50% damage to non-hero targets.",
          "cd": "7/6.8/6.6/6.4/6.2/6",
          "cost": "45",
          "tags": [
            "Drift",
            "Speed Up",
            "Damage"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/548/54810.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 54802,
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "reverse shot",
          "desc": "Goya activates the engine power of the sand boat to make the sand boat recoil a certain distance and cause 120/150/180/210/240/270 (+30% physical attack) physical damage to the target in front. At the same time, Goya fires three times at the enemy rapidly, each time causing 60/75/90/105/120/135 (+15% physical attack) physical damage.",
          "cd": "10/9.8/9.6/9.4/9.2/9",
          "cost": "70",
          "tags": [
            "Movement",
            "Damage",
            "Dash"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/548/54820.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 54803,
          "type": "Skill 3",
          "name": "Black sand explosive bomb",
          "desc": "Goya aims at an area and launches explosive arrows, gaining burst acceleration and quickly preparing to strengthen the basic attack. After a short delay, it falls, causing 350/475/600 (+50% physical attack) physical damage and 30% slowdown. The area then becomes a sandstorm area, pulling enemies to the center of the sandstorm for 5 seconds. Enemies in the sandstorm during enhanced normal attacks will cause an explosion, causing 8% of the lost health damage to enemies within the sandstorm range.",
          "cd": "45/40/35",
          "cost": "120",
          "tags": [
            "Crowd Control",
            "Pull",
            "Sandstorm"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/548/54830.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 54804,
          "type": "Skill 4",
